  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Return complete assessment, issues and questions. APPROVE requires no current/prior issue or material question, all changes SUPPORTED and every supplied gap explicitly nonmaterial. REJECT needs an actionable code issue. HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED needs a new/carried-forward material question or unresolved change/gap. Issue fields: description, evidence, location, suggestion. Evidence uses supplied E IDs or {id,start?,end?,quote?}; paired start/end are character offsets in that evidence, not code. RDF_FACT citations use the whole fact. Optional quotes are checked exactly. location uses start/end and optional unit=lines (default) or characters, on the full current candidate; software extracts exact code. Context questions/dispositions have no location and need no invented defect. Assess each supplied C ID once. REGRESSION links an actionable zero-based issue index; UNRESOLVED blocks approval. For APPROVE assess each G ID with material=false and why; material gaps require questions. Software owns hashes, IDs and reconciliation. Review supplied prior issues without returning duplicate bookkeeping. Unsupported assertions, invented references/quotes and inconsistent decisions are invalid; citation interpretation remains model judgment. Optional coverage is comparison-only instrumentation, not production acceptance or proof. Derive criteria from the represented source/scope; cite supplied evidence and valid current-code ranges if claiming implementation. No obligation is implied merely by an available schema term."
